  (34851, 0, 9, 'You can take my life, but you will not take my freedom!', 12, 0, 50, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'combat Say'),
  (34851, 0, 8, 'You were just a dog!', 12, 0, 50, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'combat Say'),
  (34851, 0, 7, 'Death of the Scourge! DIE!', 12, 0, 50, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'combat Say'),
  (34851, 0, 3, 'You make my children orphans on this day, my friend!', 12, 0, 50, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'combat Say'),
  (34851, 0, 4, 'The ... They promised we would be safe ...', 12, 0, 50, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'combat Say'),
  (34851, 0, 0, 'Why?', 12, 0, 50, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'combat Say'),
  (34851, 0, 1, 'Someone will save me!', 12, 0, 50, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'combat Say'),
  (34851, 0, 2, 'Save my life! I will leave this place forever! Please!', 12, 0, 50, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'combat Say'),
  (34851, 0, 6, 'I will not go down that easy!', 12, 0, 50, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'combat Say'),
  (34851, 0, 5, 'Ask for anything and you''ll get it! Just save my life!', 12, 0, 50, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'combat Say'),
  (34913, 0, 2, 'Hold on, soldiers!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (34913, 0, 3, 'Protect civilians!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (34850, 0, 0, 'I want the perimeter secured and the gates manned by two guards at all times. No one gets in, no one gets out.', 12, 0, 30, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'LD Text 1'),
  (34850, 1, 0, 'We protected Gilneas from the Scourge. We protected Gilneas during the Northgate rebellion. We will protect Gilneas from whatever this new threat may be.', 12, 0, 30, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'LD Text 2'),
  (34913, 0, 4, 'Shoot these beasts!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (34850, 2, 0, 'Stand ready, guards! We don''t know how many intruders we''re dealing with, but the Headlands are overrun and we''re cut off from the harbor towns. Expect to be outnumbered.', 12, 0, 30, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'LD Text 3'),
  (34851, 0, 11, 'Come on, Wolf!', 12, 0, 50, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'combat Say'),
  (34851, 0, 12, 'I am too young to die!', 12, 0, 50, 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'combat Say'),
  (34913, 0, 1, 'Courage, soldiers! We must protect the city!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (34913, 0, 0, 'Push them!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (34864, 0, 0, 'Stay calm ! Everything is under control !', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (34864, 0, 1, 'Hold them back! Have to protect the survivors!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (34864, 0, 2, 'Attention they transform our people into MONSTERS !!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (35907, 0, 0, 'Thank you! I owe you my life.', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (36332, 1, 0, 'I didn''t think so. Now hand me that potion, Krennan... and double the dosage.', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (36331, 0, 0, 'I am not giving up on you, $N. I don''t have a cure for the Curse yet... but there are treatments. You''ll have control again.', 12, 0, 100, 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Krennan Aranas'),
  (36332, 0, 0, 'Tell me, Godfrey. Those that stayed in Gilneas City so that we could live. Were they following protocol?', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (36132, 0, 0, 'Do exercise caution. Don''t expect anyone to invite you to their homes just yet. But at least they won''t shoot you outright.', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (37803, 0, 0, 'This is our land..they''re not going to take it away without a fight!', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Marcus'),
  (36291, 0, 0, 'What is happening?', 12, 0, 100, 430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Melinda Hammond'),
  (36461, 0, 0, 'I''ll be taking this cat.  It seems to work as the perfect bait.  Prepare to die now, fool!', 12, 0, 100, 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (36290, 0, 0, 'Hold your positions, men!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Seigneur Godfrey'),
  (36453, 0, 0, 'What did I do to deserve this?', 12, 0, 100, 430, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Villageois de Havre-du-Soir'),
  (36453, 0, 1, 'No, that''s not possible.', 12, 0, 100, 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Villageois de Havre-du-Soir'),
  (38781, 0, 0, 'You did it! We''re saved!', 14, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (38553, 0, 0, 'It''s time to join the fray, $N!  With you on our side the scales will surely tip in our favor!', 14, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Krennan Says'),
  (34571, 0, 0, 'Welcome back, $n. You were fortunate. Krennan''s treatment doesn''t always work this well on people who''ve had the Curse as long as you.', 12, 0, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
  (36207, 0, 0, 'Gilneas will soon belong to the Forsaken!', 12, 0, 100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Assassin rÃ©prouvÃ©'),
